# Floor invariant 16 of 16 (spec/floor-v2.md §4). Layer: floor.
# Statement carries the floor prose verbatim.
"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/invariant-16-agents-md-register"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/Invariant"
label: "AGENTS.md is the compiled graph"
layer: "floor"
statement: >
  AGENTS.md is the compiled graph: one artifact — the complete TriG compiled
  from `situation/`, injected into every agent context by the harness. Never
  hand-edited; always regenerated. Each node carries its description, its
  relationships, and a pointer to its own source document; humans read prose
  in `situation/`. After work that changes reality, re-situate it — emit
  knowledge, never rules.
